  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_building.text_4": "A seat can prevent falling from the rocket",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_building.text_5": "If the there isn't enough thrust or propellant the rocket will refuse to go",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_building.text_6": "the flight recorder can help in those moments",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.header": "Rockets debugging",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_1": "The flight recorder give info about it's last flight or no past flight if it's just placed,",
