  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_5": "add more of the missing propellant to solve the issue :",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_6": "If there is enough propellant mass but the proportion are wrong, you will get this :",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_7": "wrong propellant ratio",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_8": "equilibrate the propellants to solve the issue",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_9": "if the rocket is too heavy you will get :",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_10": "not enough thrust",
  "creatingspace.ponder.rocket_debugging.text_11": "add more engines to solve the issue",
